{"is_source_file": true, "format": "JavaScript/React JSX", "description": "This file defines a React context provider component (`DataProvider`) and a custom hook (`useDataContext`) for managing and sharing application-wide data such as users and sessions. It fetches data from API functions (`listUsers` and `listSessions`), maintains loading and error states, and provides refresh functions. The context data is initialized once on app mount and includes mechanisms to prevent duplicate fetches.", "external_files": ["../api"], "external_methods": ["listUsers", "listSessions"], "published": ["useDataContext", "DataProvider"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "useDataContext()", "description": "A React hook to consume the DataContext, providing access to users and sessions data along with their loading/error states and refresh functions.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "DataProvider({ children })", "description": "A React component that provides centralized, cached data for users and sessions to its child components. It loads data once at mount and manages states for loading, errors, and data refreshes.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}], "calls": ["React.createContext", "useContext", "useState", "useCallback", "useEffect", "useMemo", "useRef", "listUsers", "listSessions"], "search-terms": ["DataContext", "React context for data", "useDataContext hook", "DataProvider component", "users/loading/error state", "sessions/loading/error state", "initial data load", "cached data management"], "state": 2, "file_id": 7719, "knowledge_revision": 17769, "git_revision": "81a2f7262178723fc6e54ec2353ea854182f675b", "ctags": [{"_type": "tag", "name": "DataContext", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/data-management-dashboard-144914-144924/mongodb_dashboard_frontend/src/context/DataContext.jsx", "pattern": "/^const DataContext = createContext({$/", "language": "JavaScript", "kind": "constant"}, {"_type": "tag", "name": "DataProvider", "path": "/home/kavia/workspac